   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p><img src=\"exercises/media/5251791f3dfdc76e.jpg\" alt=\"Two spheres, A and B, are illustrated. A is labelled with a radius of 5 microns. B is much larger and is labelled with a radius of 50 microns.\"></p>\n\n<p>Pictured are two cells along with their radius. What does cell B likely have when compared to cell A?</p>\n",
